<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22716" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γουνός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>high ground</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυτὸν ὣς γουνῷ ἀλωῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					18.57
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνὰ γουνὸν ἀλωῆς οἰνοπέδοιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					1.193
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ Κρήτης ἐς γουνὸν Ἀθηνάων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.323
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς Ἀττικῆς . . τὸν γ. τὸν Σουνιακόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.99
				</span></i>
			: pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γουνοῖσιν Ἐλευθῆρος μεδέουσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					54
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γουνοῖσιν κατένασσε
			Νεμείης</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				329
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν γουνοῖς Ἀθανᾶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>I.</u>
					4(3).25
				</span></i>
			. (Expld. as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόπος
			γονιμώτατος</span> by Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
			</span></i> l.c., but better as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑψηλὸς
			τόπος</span> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γόνυ</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Orion
				38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				239.5
			</span></i>.)</div>
